      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xiv-1-grave-warden-terminator-squad-source" hidden="true">
          <description>Grave Warden | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 2+/4+
Chem-master | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 2+/4+
Force Organisation:
• Heavy Support
Unit Composition:
SHROUDED IN DEATH A Grave Warden Terminator Squad counts as being equipped with Defensive Grenades. All normal ProHammer rules for Defensive Grenades apply. Grave Warden Weapons Weapon Range S AP Type Assault Grenade Launcher — Krak 18" 6 4 Assault 2 Assault Grenade Launcher — Toxin 18" 1 5 Assault 4, Poisoned (3+), Ignores Cover Death Cloud Projector Template 1 4 Assault 1, Poisoned (3+), Ignores Cover
• 4 Grave Wardens
• 1 Chem-master
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Chem-master is a Character
Wargear:
• Cataphractii Terminator Armour
• Assault Grenade Launcher
• Death Cloud Projector
• Power fist
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Death Guard)
• Shrouded in Death
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Grave Wardens for +50 points per model.
• Any model may replace his Power fist with:
• Chainfist ....................................... +5 points
• The Chem-master may take:
• Grenade Harness ................................ +10 points
• The Chem-master may select up to 50 points of permitted Terminator weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Land Raider, Dreadclaw Drop Pod orSpartan Assault Tank where Transport Capacity permits.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="r11-dg-gw-shroud" name="Shrouded in Death" hidden="false"><description>A Grave Warden Terminator Squad counts as being equipped with Defensive Grenades. All normal ProHammer rules for Defensive Grenades apply.</description></rule><rule id="r11-dg-gw-wargear" name="Wargear" hidden="false"><description>Cataphractii Terminator Armour; Assault Grenade Launcher; Death Cloud Projector; Power fist.</description></rule></rules>
