      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xiv-2-mortus-poisoner-squad-source" hidden="true">
          <description>Mortus Poisoner | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 1 | 9 | 3+
Poison-master | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
DESTROYER CADRE The Mortus Poisoners use the normal Destroyer Cadre rule from the Legiones Astartes Army List.
Unit Composition:
• 4 Mortus Poisoners
• 1 Poison-master
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Poison-master is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Alchem Flamer
• Bolt pistol
• Chainsword
• Frag grenades
• Rad grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Death Guard)
• Counter-Attack
• Destroyer Cadre
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Mortus Poisoners for +20 points per model.
• For every five models in the squad, one Mortus Poisoner may take:
• Phosphex Bomb .................................. +10 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ............................ +2 points per model
• Melta bombs .............................. +5 points per model
POISON-MASTER
The Poison-master may replace his Chainsword with:
• Rending Weapon .................................... +5 points
• Power weapon ..................................... +10 points
• Power fist ....................................... +15 points
The Poison-master may take:
• Artificer Armour ................................. +10 points
• Up to three Phosphex Bombs ...................... +10 points each
The Poison-master may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="r11-dg-mp-destroyer" name="Destroyer Cadre" hidden="false"><description>The Mortus Poisoners use the normal Destroyer Cadre rule from the Legiones Astartes Army List.</description></rule><rule id="r11-dg-mp-wargear" name="Wargear" hidden="false"><description>Power Armour; Alchem Flamer; Bolt pistol; Chainsword; Frag grenades; Rad grenades.</description></rule></rules>
      <selectionEntries>
