      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r11-dg-mortarion-deathshroud-r41-unit-xiv-0-deathshroud-terminators-source" hidden="true">
          <description>Deathshroud | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 2+/5+
SILENT RETINUE A Death Guard character who would normally be permitted to select a Legion Terminator Command Squad may instead select one Deathshroud Terminator Squad as his retinue. The Deathshroud do not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot. The character and Deathshroud count as a single HQ selection.
Force Organisation:
• Elites
Unit Composition:
• 2 Deathshroud Terminators
Unit Type:
• Infantry
Wargear:
• Terminator Armour
• Manreaper
• Alchem Flamer
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Death Guard)
• Fearless
• Silent Retinue
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Deathshroud Terminators for +55 points per model.
• The entire squad may exchange its Terminator Armour for Cataphractii Terminator Armour at no additional cost.
If this option is selected, the squad instead has a 2+/4+ Save and follows all normal rules and restrictions for Cataphractii Terminator Armour.
• The entire squad may take:
• Melta bombs .............................. +5 points per model
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Land Raider, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Spartan Assault Tank where Transport Capacity permits.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="r11-dg-mortarion-deathshroud-r11-dg-ds-silent" name="Silent Retinue" hidden="false"><description>A Death Guard character who would normally be permitted to select a Legion Terminator Command Squad may instead select one Deathshroud Terminator Squad as his retinue. It occupies no separate Force Organisation slot.</description></rule><rule id="r11-dg-mortarion-deathshroud-r11-dg-ds-wargear" name="Wargear" hidden="false"><description>Terminator Armour; Manreaper; Alchem Flamer.</description></rule><rule id="r11-dg-mortarion-deathshroud-rule" name="Retinue" hidden="false"><description>Selected as this character’s retinue. It occupies no separate Force Organisation slot.</description></rule></rules>
